{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_060_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_060_title", "source_sha256": "774cba4fbf4d059401bdc7a66dc019240ec8e4b5df84eabfb53fde5692266adf", "ja": "キミに伝えたくて", "zh": "想要传达给你", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_060_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_060_synopsis", "source_sha256": "32ba630d81992439308d3257b79842b70d5db671778cbc097ff3db88c4c2629a", "ja": "次の莉緒の新曲は、大人のせつないラブソン\nグ。だが莉緒は歌に込める気持ちが掴めずに\n悩む。みんなと話し、大切なのはまず自分が\nドキドキする事だと気付いた莉緒は、公演当\n日、溢れる気持ちを客席に届けるのだった。", "zh": "莉绪的新歌是一首成熟伤感的情歌。\n然而莉绪却苦恼于无法把握歌中该融入的情感。\n在与大家交流后，莉绪意识到最重要的\n是先让自己感到心动。到了公演当天，\n她将满溢的情感传达给了台下的观众。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_060_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_060_1000_046rio", "source_sha256": "fc500cbe41a6d6c2a9ffcbf0ad69410178f2cc72b5f94b9c176578dc19c40c45", "ja": "みんな……\n私の想い、届いたかな？", "zh": "大家……\n我的心意，传达到了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_060_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_060_1001_audience", "source_sha256": "fad0e00d4f2aa0b45a06fc14c635a29f903ad0a0ed8030245260de65e03f54d8", "ja": "わああああああ！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_060_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_060_1002_046rio", "source_sha256": "cb6dd794e6cf74245f44541b758799f009355d5a108c8b2b55cb9867550e947a", "ja": "ふふっ、よかった……。\n受け取ってくれて、ありがとう～！", "zh": "呵呵，太好了……\n谢谢你愿意收下～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_060_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_060_1003_audience", "source_sha256": "1e156150e313d5fc8b5fa2ee01adeb880088e72e24fd2cbaba0c8618c1bbf8a2", "ja": "わああああああああああ！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_060_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_060_1004_046rio", "source_sha256": "64ffd40bc7c86e8379c222d87e1735fe8f3c6f1a986b9cbfd93682835a22b7f2", "ja": "……いたいた、{$P$}くーん！\nね、どうだった？　今日の私のステージ！", "zh": "……找到了，{$P$}君！\n喂，怎么样？我今天的舞台！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_060_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_060_1005_p", "source_sha256": "dadf97e76576cf6177b9841001f9b16a5de817cd76c99b7fb2dd2df87848329c", "ja": "お疲れさま、莉緒！　聞くまでもないだろ？\nまだ鳴りやまないこの歓声が、その答えだよ！", "zh": "辛苦了，莉绪！这还用问吗？\n到现在还没有停下的欢呼声，就是答案啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_060_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_060_1006_046rio", "source_sha256": "fbc3b6bef0d0674c82a10b17e43434971c5c6f9a7fb20520e70099dd457d7d9b", "ja": "んもう、違う～！\n私は、キミがどう思ったかを聞きたいのっ。", "zh": "真是的，不是啦～！\n我想听的是，你怎么觉得的嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_060_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_060_1007_p", "source_sha256": "71c9449216beaabcc5507ff89b293b0e1f0ab0e181b57704e54c1939d19af26b", "ja": "え、それは……そうだな。\n俺もすっかり、ここで聴き入ってたよ。", "zh": "诶，这个嘛……怎么说呢。\n我也完全听入迷了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_060_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_060_1008_p", "source_sha256": "3414b3db56ed11ab363f5f2cda07a80fe80731a9f20c31ac0f2ea8d2a9de5fb9", "ja": "莉緒の気持ちが伝わってきて……引きこまれて。\nずっと莉緒から、目が離せなかった。", "zh": "我感受到了莉绪的心情……不知不觉就被吸引住了。一直都没法把视线从莉绪身上移开。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_060_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_060_1009_046rio", "source_sha256": "efd761220bff9a8e1c2d3f60d56eee0e58e239b5b413eb033fdaecb324418990", "ja": "そ……そっか。そんなに感じてくれてたんだ……。\n……よかった。ありがと……。", "zh": "这……这样啊。你能感受到那么多啊……\n……太好了。谢谢你……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_060_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_060_1010_046rio", "source_sha256": "453cc035de4fe39e11c3bf3a746baedb37c04f249f981a6e8dd758841e69d59e", "ja": "ま、まあ、つまり{$P$}くんも、\n私の魅力のトリコになっちゃった、ってことよね！", "zh": "嗯、嗯，也就是说，{$P$}君也已经成为我魅力的俘虏了，对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_060_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_060_1011_p", "source_sha256": "c4f7ebb6805632e0160be5bb8151e8b00a34518bad063b0d0c8630a26c3171fe", "ja": "それは……最初に出会った時からかな？\nでないと、プロデュースなんてできないから。", "zh": "应该是……从我们第一次见面时就开始了吧？不然的话，也没法当我的制作人啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_060_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_060_1012_046rio", "source_sha256": "9c6df429d9dd92d161fbf893d24a070a8edbf7c0a35d441f4ebce67a00c03e60", "ja": "……！　も、もうっ。\nなに言ってるのよ…………、バカ。", "zh": "……！　真是的。\n你在说什么呢…………大笨蛋。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_060_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_060_1013_p", "source_sha256": "c85f5c1ab844f355a12cd0be1bd396c086a50cef9b011048e507b8f41175a801", "ja": "それに、突然何かやらかさないかも心配で。\nそういう意味でも、目が離せなかった。", "zh": "而且我还担心你会不会突然搞出什么事来。\n从这个意义上说，也一直没法把视线从你身上移开。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_060_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_060_1014_046rio", "source_sha256": "d20f9e3be1917cd2ce5bdd5fca73b0106a72615f5a400be33f9825f30ddd9cc7", "ja": "……あ。今ヒドイこと言ったでしょ。\nねえ、ヒドイこと言ったでしょ！", "zh": "……啊。你刚才说了很过分的话吧。\n喂，你说了很过分的话对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_060_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_060_1015_052kao", "source_sha256": "eba5b8654b74cbaa451daad402f9502919730ec9be86fc14d78c27dab39f825b", "ja": "莉緒ちゃん、お疲れさま！\n気持ちのこもった、素敵なステージだったわね！", "zh": "莉绪，辛苦了！\n刚才是个饱含心意的精彩舞台呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_060_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_060_1016_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f110ee4d1f10e3d4541dccebcecd7ff74c87cefa4eba3a0515cfdab80ee2a198", "ja": "わたしも、後ろで踊ってて\nキュンってしちゃいました！", "zh": "我在后面跳舞时，也不由得心动了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_060_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_060_1017_010azu", "source_sha256": "d3af72766922b18bb535a07180496fe0fbd0beebe914fe60829cd32b94a54207", "ja": "本当に。ふふっ、恋するせつない気持ちって、\nどうしてこんなに、胸に響くのかしら♪", "zh": "真的呢。呵呵，恋爱时那种酸涩的心情，\n为什么会如此触动心弦呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_060_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_060_1018_007ior", "source_sha256": "604abbd4cb9ca130358613225b902bbcf1ffb0e524a7543816d5a4852c92b062", "ja": "そうね。なんていうか……\nうん、とっても良かったわ！", "zh": "是啊。怎么说呢……\n嗯，真的很棒呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_060_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_060_1019_016tsu", "source_sha256": "8511d0bba4cabe617d74f348da4ffcc0518d9d24ce9c5c9484e528d3b3e2c49c", "ja": "ところで莉緒さん、{$P$}さんと\n何の話をしてたんですか？", "zh": "对了，莉绪姐，刚才和{$P$}先生聊什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_060_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_060_1020_046rio", "source_sha256": "1f4b0503b3c3376d8ea9e80926459b85d6b58f803347e2cd405430142e5f4235", "ja": "あ、それは、えっと……", "zh": "啊，那个，呃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_060_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_060_1021_046rio", "source_sha256": "7ad47167edb0b00f5497aac79d6aae2b0d4ad1a3d67af4a00af3dd10b03600cd", "ja": "{$P$}くんが、\n私のトリコになっちゃったっていうお話♪", "zh": "{$P$}变成我的俘虏了，就是这么回事♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_060_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_060_1022_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f6c658acd7255369d6e19bb976bf7fa75ddd9cba3fef63a2200f9640ac75adf0", "ja": "ええ～～～！？　そうなんですか、\n{$P$}さん！？", "zh": "诶诶诶——！？是这样的吗，{$P$}先生！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_060_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_060_1023_007ior", "source_sha256": "c20ef4590393c4a59e74858ae1be0b9cfab260a929176911649becf7e3bcd67a", "ja": "ちょっと！\nアンタ、仕事中に何考えてんのよ～！", "zh": "喂！\n你工作时间都在想些什么呀～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_060_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_060_1024_p", "source_sha256": "78d2ae15b140d71ffe859feef6d5077e0f98f4561a831fb39cade096833cb390", "ja": "うわっ、待ってくれ！\nそんな、真に受けなくても……！", "zh": "哇，等等！\n用不着这么当真吧……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_060_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_060_1025_046rio", "source_sha256": "a6182268415b7fd63b69647975d0dc7644c8bb97db71195264edcb563ad2e7b2", "ja": "あら、嘘は言ってないと思うけど？\nうふふっ♪", "zh": "哎呀，我觉得我也没说谎呀？\n呜呼呼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_060_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_060_1026_audience", "source_sha256": "fad0e00d4f2aa0b45a06fc14c635a29f903ad0a0ed8030245260de65e03f54d8", "ja": "わああああああ！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_060_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_060_1027_052kao", "source_sha256": "402c8aa7e99e1cdf2db79d559bc0c3cd2ad52ad4aa62a093685524a6e68ec522", "ja": "ふふっ、それはそれとして。\n莉緒ちゃん、お客さんが呼んでるみたいよ？", "zh": "呵呵，先不说这个。莉绪，观众好像在叫你哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_060_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_060_1028_010azu", "source_sha256": "c409de3588d944c1c028683d2ea41fdcc923120bd81ea44b8d5173b6f40bbe0c", "ja": "ふふっ、私達もだけれど……お客さん達も、\nまだまだ、ドキドキが治まらないみたいね♪", "zh": "呵呵，我们也是如此，不过……客人们似乎也还没能平复激动的心情呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_060_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_060_1029_p", "source_sha256": "f8f2f552661ad97527fe54b21e710b78bf1f617767484160c28a0f01f06b538a", "ja": "今日のステージで、莉緒のことを\nもっと好きになった人がいっぱいいるんじゃないか。", "zh": "今天的舞台上，应该有很多人更喜欢莉绪了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_060_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_060_1030_046rio", "source_sha256": "1a4edf24fc102ffa0dd3960ff0a2ce4ef28315511455ef3a09b599376f89d031", "ja": "そうね……。ライブなんだし、\n盛り上がって終わらないとよね！", "zh": "是啊……既然是现场演出，就得让气氛嗨起来再结束！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_060_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_060_1031_046rio", "source_sha256": "faab81f7aeaf21968eb18922104ab3f04961049dfbe83e825df6b962786ed2ec", "ja": "みんな、大人の魅力で盛り上げていきましょう！", "zh": "大家，用成熟的魅力把气氛炒热起来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_060_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_060_1032_016tsu", "source_sha256": "681433e6ab3f02ea9edb84132a4473050efa35a3238a01719f184bf7d718778f", "ja": "はーい！　がんばりまーす！", "zh": "好～！我会加油的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_060_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_060_1033_046rio", "source_sha256": "e67f633f3c4ee1a8bb7e937d239cdb9fdb284113cac19c0f8e2293863ce3afab", "ja": "{$P$}くん、あとでちゃんとした\n感想、聞かせてもらうわよ！　じゃ、行ってくるわね♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生，待会儿可要好好告诉我你的感想哦！那我先走啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_060_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_060_1034_p", "source_sha256": "35e97d69b59fc758256cc42a65748f9719d8352684b88e5570bcde1fa5579428", "ja": "ああ、しっかり見ておくから、\n張り切っていってこい！", "zh": "啊，我会认真看着的，你就好好加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
